# Reference-data area. Never commit large or license-gated RAW downloads.
# Small, public-domain, curated text derivatives (CSV/JSON) ARE tracked so the
# branch is self-contained and inspectable; regenerate via data/scripts/*.

# Large / binary / license-gated raw downloads:
*.zip
*.mdb
*.tgz
*.gz
*.txt
*.xlsx
cms-ncd/*
cms-formulary/*
npi/*
openfda/*

# Re-include docs and small curated derivatives:
!.gitignore
!**/README.md
